<div id="urduTextPath">چہلم اور واپسی/چہلم جو کربلا میں بہتر کا ہو چکا</div>

<p>chehlum jo karbala me bahattar ka ho chuka<br />
paiwand bekaso'n ke tan-o- sar ka ho chuka<br />
aur faateha hussain ke lashkar ka ho chuka<br />
qabro'n pa shor aale- payambar ka ho chuka</p>

<p>maatam me teen roz rahe shor-o- shain se<br />
roye lipat lipat ke mazaaree hussain se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>misle charaagh gor-e- gharibaa'n pa dil jalaaye<br />
phoolo'n ke badle qabro'n pe laqt-e- jigar chadhaaye<br />
pyaaro'n ki bud-o- baash ke saamaa'n jo yaad aaye<br />
be saaqta pukaare kaleje pakad ke haaye</p>

<p>hai hai wo parda daar hamaare kidhar gaye<br />
be parda hoke aale nabi dar badar gaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maqtal ke aas paas ye bewo'n ki thi fughaa'n<br />
zainab jabee'n lahad pa dhare karti thi bayaa'n<br />
aye mere karbalaai baradar hussain jaa'n<br />
hamsheer teen din se tumhaari hai mehmaa'n</p>

<p>allah meri baat bhi poochi na aap ne<br />
zindaa'n ki waaredaat bhi poochi na aap ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>raazi hu jo razaa-e- imaam-e- jaleel hai<br />
par qaabil-e- mulaaheza baazu ka neel hai<br />
ne koi daad rasan na koi kafeel hai<br />
bhaai baghair aap ke zainab zaleel hai</p>

<p>pusht-o- panaah uth gaya be qaanumaa'n huwi<br />
dekho ye pusht qaabil-e- noke sinaa'n huwi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>marjaaye sab yatimou'n ke sar par rahu to mai<br />
bachpan me unki qaid ki eezaa sahu to mai<br />
behlaane ko tumhaari kahaani kahu to mai<br />
maa hu to mai phupi hu to mai baap hu to mai</p>

<p>inka bhi daagh aaj mile ya ke kal mile<br />
aise nahi naseeb ke qidmat ka phal mile<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mai jaanti thi shehr basa hoga bhaai ka<br />
hoga hujoom qabr pa saari qudaayi ka<br />
chahlum karungi dhoom se mai karbalaayi ka<br />
pursaa'n bhi yaa koi nahi zehra ki jaayi ka</p>

<p>mu dhaanpne ko aap hi palla bhi leti hu<br />
aur apne dil ko aap hi pursa bhi deti hu<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chehlum to kar chuki mai dilafgaar yaa hussain<br />
ab rouza kis tarha se ho tayyar yaa hussain<br />
beta bhi aur behen bhi hai naadar yaa hussain<br />
aaqir kabhi tho aayenge zawwar yaa hussain</p>

<p>takya hai kaar saziye parwardigaar par<br />
is dam to saaebaa'n bhi nahi hai mazaar par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hone laga sawaar rasaala basheer ka<br />
danka bajaa haram ke waidaa-e- aqeer ka<br />
qaima uthaa lahed se shah-e- mashraqain ka<br />
aur sab tabarrukaat janab-e- ameer ka</p>

<p>turbat ke gird oont barabar khade huwe<br />
ruqsat ko jamma qabr pa chote bade huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zainab pukaari kooch ka saamaan hogaya<br />
phir shehr mere bhaai ka veeraan hogaya<br />
aur maqberaa hussain ka sunsaan hogaya<br />
hoo ka maqaam qatl ka maidaan hogaya</p>

<p>aayi musaafirou ko mere wo zamee'n pasand<br />
dunya me jis zameen ko basti nahi pasand<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye karbalaa-e- sarwar-e- dilgeer alweda<br />
aye qatlgaah-e- hazrat-e- shabbir alweda<br />
aye qabr-e- ibn-e- saaheb-e- tat'heer alweda<br />
aye bhaai jaan jaati hai hamsheer alweda</p>

<p>kya be naseeb hai ye nawaasi rasool ki<br />
tum ne mujaaweri na hamaari qubool ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bhaiyya utho kajaawe me mujh ko tum hi bithaao<br />
bhaiyya mai be naqaab hu rehgiro'n ko hataao<br />
roke'n qanat akbar-o- abbas ko bulaao<br />
qaali hai god bhaabi ki asghar ko lete aao</p>

<p>sardaar saare qaafele ke aage hote hai<br />
tayyar kaarwaa'n huwa aur aap sote hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kab se tumhe pukaar rahi hu mai qasta tan<br />
hai hai jawaab bhi nahi dete shah-e- zaman<br />
bhaiyya gale lagaalo to jaau sue watan<br />
aayi nida sidhaaro quda haafiz aye bahan</p>

<p>sughra ko meri simth se bhi pyaar kijiyo<br />
hoga sawaab qaatir-e- beemaar kijiyo<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>